WEBVTT

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.940
(SNIFFLING)

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:29.220
I know you don't want me to but...

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:31.740
I miss home.

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:35.300
I miss Minnesota.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:41.860
You need me to be happy, but...

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:48.220
I want my old friends,
and my hockey team.

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:52.100
I want to go home.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.580
Please don't be mad.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.140
Oh, sweetie.

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:01.580
We're not mad.

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:06.740
You know what? I miss Minnesota too.

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:11.140
I miss the woods where we took hikes.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:14.340
And the backyard
where you used to play.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:18.060
Spring Lake,
where you learned to skate.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.300
Come here.

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:22.940
(SOBBING)

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:52.940
(BREATHES DEEPLY)

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:44.460
FEAR: Hey, I'm liking this new view.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:45.980
ANGER: Friendship Island
has expanded.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:48.540
Glad they finally opened
that Friendly Argument section.

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:50.860
I like Tragic Vampire Romance Island.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:53.540
Fashion Island? Oh. Everyone shut up.

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.860
Boy Band Island?
Hope that's just a phase.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.860
Say what you want,
I think it's all beautiful.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:02:59.940
(DRILL WHIRRING)

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:01.260
All right. Here you go.

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:04.180
Your new expanded console
is up and runnin'.

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:05.700
-Ooh!
-Wow!

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:07.140
-Cool! Upgrade!
-Ooh!

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.340
-Hey! Whoa-ho!
-(BEEPS)

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:09.620
Whoops, wait. Did I just do that?

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:12.140
Hey, guys? What's pub-er-ty?

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:14.220
I don't know. It's probably not important.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:18.340
Whoa. I have access to
the entire curse word library!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.980
This new console is the...

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:21.540
(BEEPS)

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:23.220
Sorry. I did it again. My bad.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:24.300
They're getting to the rink.

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:27.940
DAD: Now when you get out there,
you be aggressive!

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:29.740
-I know, Dad.
-MOM: But not too aggressive.

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:32.380
You know, you guys don't
have to come to every game.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:34.420
Are you kidding? I'm not missing one!

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:35.540
Go Foghorns!

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.580
Go Riley! Foghorns are the best!

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:39.420
-(DAD BELLOWING)
-Okay! I got to go!

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.420
-Aw!
-They love us.

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:43.140
Yeah, Mom and Dad are pretty cool.

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:45.740
Guys, of course they are.
But we can't show it.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:47.900
(ALL CHEERING)

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:49.380
She loved the face painting!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:50.980
Ha! Told you it was a great idea!

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:53.740
Best idea he's had in a while.

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:55.340
He's a really good guy.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:56.620
(ALL SIGH)

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:01.180
Just in case.

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:03.460
Oh!

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.140
Sorry.

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:10.220
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:12.620
ALARM: Girl! Girl! Girl!

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:17.020
Uh... Okay. Bye.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:21.620
COACH: Remember, just hustle.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.100
GIRL 1: Go, Riley!

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.140
GIRL 2: You got this!

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:28.820
-You ready?
-Yeah.

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:31.260
All right. Let's play some hockey!

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:33.500
-(WHISTLE BLOWING)
-JOY: All right, Anger, take it!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.700
ANGER: Give us that puck
or you're dead meat!

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:35.780
FEAR: On our left. On our left!

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:37.460
DISGUST: Let's just try not
to get all smelly this time.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:39.940
SADNESS: Oh. Mom and Dad
are watching us fail.

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:41.140
ANGER: Not for long!

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:44.780
JOY: We've been through
a lot lately, that's for sure.

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:46.620
But we still love our girl.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:49.500
She has great new friends,
a great new house.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:50.860
Things couldn't be better.

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:55.100
After all, Riley's twelve now.
What could happen?

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:19.180
And who can tell me what year
San Francisco was founded?

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:21.260
Anyone? Jordan?

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:23.260
JORDAN: Uh...

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:25.180
How much more of this?

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.380
Five months, two weeks and four days

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:28.980
until summer vacation.

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:32.220
Then it's off to the Bahamas
with you know who!

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:35.380
Come fly with me, gatinha.

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:37.380
(ALL SIGH)

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.180
(CASH REGISTER RINGING)

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:40.980
Have a nice day.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.060
What are we mad about?

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.180
I don't know.
Whatever Troy's mad about.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:46.620
What's Troy mad about?

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.060
I don't know.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.060
I know. Totally.

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:52.300
We're a total fraud!

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:53.700
Do you think they can see through us?

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:55.700
Of course not!
We're wearing eye shadow!

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:57.580
Being cool is so exhausting.

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:03.740
Who's the birthday girl?
Huh? Hey! Hello?

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:08.740
Six years of drama school for this?

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:10.220
WOMAN: Move it, will you?

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:11.300
(HORNS HONKING)

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:12.980
(GIRL BABBLING NOISILY)

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:15.020
ALL: What are you doing? Come on!

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:16.860
You know what?
This is okay. This is fine.

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:19.100
We just need to go to our happy place.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:20.220
♪ TripleDent gum ♪

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:22.060
-No! Not this again!
-(ALL EXCLAIMING)

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:26.420
(SNIFFING)

00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:28.260
(DOG BARKING)

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:42.780
(MEOWING)

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:45.780
(HISSING)

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:49.620
(BEEPING)

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.580
(SCREECHING)

